# The repo root ignores *.log / *.json under "# Results" -- correct in general,
# since most result files are transient job output nobody should commit.
#
# This directory is the exception: these logs ARE the deliverable. Every number
# in ../README.md is parsed out of them, and a result table whose raw evidence
# is not in the tree is a table you cannot re-check later. Un-ignore them here
# rather than weakening the root rule for the whole repo.
#
# Keep this narrow. New runs land here by default; commit them deliberately,
# and only when the README cites them.
!*.log
!*.json
